# featuredocs/.gitignore
#
# This folder is maintained in the gramps_devutil repo and copied into each
# Gramps feature repo.  In a feature repo, the copied shared tooling must stay
# out of that repo's history -- fix it in gramps_devutil instead.  In
# gramps_devutil itself these files are tracked, so listing them here has no
# effect there.
#
# Feature-specific work (README_<feature>.md and the screenshots in images/)
# is NOT ignored, so it can be committed in the feature repo.

# --- this file (copied in from gramps_devutil) -----------------------------
/.gitignore

# --- shared tooling copied from gramps_devutil ------------------------------
/build_feature_docs.py
/create_example_wiki.bash
/devnotes/
/scripts/check_missing_images.py
/scripts/md_to_mediawiki.py
/templates/footer.mediawiki
/templates/header.mediawiki

# --- generated by build_feature_docs.py (rebuilt on every run) -------------
/*_prompt.txt
/*_image_audit.txt
/*.mediawiki
/changed_files.txt

# --- Python bytecode (build_feature_docs.py imports scripts/md_to_mediawiki)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
